            "name": "body",
            "value": "<p><sup>1</sup> Income for life is subject to following the terms of your contract.</p>\n<p><sup>2</sup> With the purchase of any additional-cost riders, the contract’s value will be reduced by the cost of the rider. This may result in a loss of principal and interest or credits in any year in which the contract does not earn interest or credits in an amount more than the rider fee. </p>\n<hr>"
